.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt FILEES-PUBLIC-AUTHORITY 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-public-authority
.Nd FileES Public Shares backchannel and recipient OTP
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl config Ar path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the authoritative side of Public Shares.
It listens only on a protected Unix socket.
Raw TCP, including loopback, is rejected.
For a split deployment use reverse SSH with Unix sockets at both ends.
It never terminates TLS.
It fetches leaves with
.Nm svnlook
and pushes them to
.Xr filees-links 8 .
.Pp
Provision the socket directory before starting the service:
0700 for a private socket, or 0750 with the configured socket group.
The directory and its ancestry must not be writable by untrusted accounts.
The listener uses mode 0600, or 0660 with an explicit socket group.
It refuses to replace a live socket, a non-socket or an ambiguous endpoint.
A stale socket owned by the service is removed only after a refused connection
proves that no listener is present.
.Pp
It supervises
.Xr filees-mail 8
.Cm public-loop
as a required child.
The child holds the SMTP secret.
.Nm
does not.
On
.Dv SIGTERM
or
.Dv SIGINT
it closes the HTTP server, terminates the child and waits, then exits,
so an
.Xr rcctl 8
restart cannot leave an orphan poller.
.Pp
Recipient OTP epochs, attempt counters and invitation hashes live under
the Public Shares state root.
Revoke and delete cut access immediately and drop pending mail.
They do not yet garbage-collect inactive epoch files; those files contain
no mailbox and no plaintext code.
.Sh FILES
Staging follows
.Ic public_shares.authority_staging_root
in server.json.
The directory must survive system temporary cleanup.
Changing or recreating an unveiled root requires a service restart.
Authorized fetches with unavailable local storage return generic HTTP 503;
authorization denial remains HTTP 404.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/filees/server.json
Public Shares section.
See
.Xr filees.conf 5 .
.It Pa /var/run/filees/public-authority.sock
Default Unix backchannel.
.It Pa /etc/rc.d/filees_public_authority
Disabled-by-default
.Ox
rc.d script.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-public-links 5 ,
